 918: /// Remove finished logs in `dir` beyond the newest `keep`, newest by when
 919: /// each run last wrote to its log; returns the logs removed.
 920: ///
 921: /// Holds `dir`'s prune lock throughout, so two runs finishing at once do not
 922: /// race, and touches only finished logs: never a partial (a running log, or
 923: /// one not yet recovered) and never a file that is not a log. Waits for the
 924: /// lock, so call it from blocking code.
